---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home',             item: 'https://yonolink.co' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Editorial Policy', item: 'https://yonolink.co/editorial-policy' },
  ],
};
---
<BaseLayout title="Editorial Policy — YonoLink Content Standards" description="Our editorial standards and review process for YonoLink game reviews, app guides and promo code listings. All content is independently produced and verified before publication." schema={breadcrumbSchema}>
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white mb-3">Editorial Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Our Editorial Standards</h2>
        <p>YonoLink.co is an independent information resource for players of Yono real-cash gaming apps in India. Every piece of content we publish — whether a game review, guide, or promo code listing — is held to three core principles: accuracy, editorial independence, and putting the user first. We only publish information we have verified or can reasonably substantiate, we do not allow commercial relationships to shape our editorial conclusions, and all content is written with the reader's interests as the primary consideration. We do not make claims about earnings potential or guaranteed outcomes, and we are clear about the risks involved in real-money gaming.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">How We Review Games</h2>
        <p>Our review methodology is designed to give players an honest, practical picture of each app. For every game we cover, we research the app's features, payout records and speed, user ratings across major platforms, download and verification process, and any known complaints or issues reported by the player community. We consider ease of use, customer support responsiveness, bonus structures, and withdrawal reliability. We do not accept payment, gifted credits, or any other form of compensation from operators to feature an app favourably, to alter our ratings, or to suppress negative findings. Ratings reflect our independent assessment only.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Promo Code Verification</h2>
        <p>Promo codes and bonus offers are verified before being listed on this site. We check each code against the operator's own promotions, confirm it is active, and test it where possible before publication. Our promo code listings are updated up to three times daily to remove expired codes and add newly confirmed ones. Where we know a code's expiry date or usage limit, we include that information alongside the listing. Codes can expire without notice from operators; if you find a listed code is no longer working, please contact us so we can remove it promptly.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Independence &amp; Conflicts of Interest</h2>
        <p>YonoLink.co is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by any Yono gaming platform or operator. We may earn affiliate commissions when a user downloads an app via a referral link on this site. This commercial arrangement does not influence our editorial ratings, review conclusions, or the selection of apps we choose to cover. Affiliate relationships are disclosed in our site-wide disclaimer. Apps we rate poorly are not removed from the site because of a commercial relationship; conversely, apps we rate highly are not ranked that way because of commission rates. Editorial and commercial decisions are kept separate.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Content Updates</h2>
        <p>The gaming app landscape in India changes rapidly — apps update their features, change their bonus terms, and occasionally cease operating. We review all published content on a regular basis to ensure it remains accurate and up to date. Every article and review on YonoLink.co carries a "Last updated" date so readers can assess how current the information is. If significant changes occur with a featured app between scheduled reviews, we aim to update the relevant content as quickly as possible once we become aware of the change.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Corrections Policy</h2>
        <p>We take accuracy seriously. If we publish information that turns out to be incorrect — whether a factual error in a review, an outdated claim, or a mistaken promo code detail — we correct it promptly. Corrections are made clearly and transparently: we update the relevant page, note the nature of the correction where appropriate, and revise the "Last updated" date. We do not silently delete or alter content to hide previous errors. If you believe you have found an error on any page of this site, we welcome your report and will investigate it.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Contact the Editorial Team</h2>
        <p>For editorial enquiries, factual corrections, or questions about our review methodology, please reach out to us directly. We read all messages and aim to respond within a few business days.</p>
        <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:Yonolinksupportcenter@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2">Yonolinksupportcenter@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
